Here is a complete, modular, production-grade Enterprise Document Management System (EDMS) designed in C# (.NET 8). 

The architecture is divided into three highly decoupled modules unified through an integration coordinator. It avoids external third-party dependencies by using modern .NET primitives, featuring low-allocation streaming patterns, lock-free thread-safe concurrency, and strict zero-placeholder execution.

```
EnterpriseDMS/
├── Core/             (Common Domain Models, Security Contexts & Exceptions)
├── UploadGateway/    (Zero-Allocation Parser, Stream-based AV Scanning & Safe Disk Storage)
├── IndexingEngine/   (Regex Tokenizer, Thread-Safe Inverted Index & TF-IDF Scoring Engine)
├── Security/         (Hierarchical RBAC, Attribute-Based Access Control & Policy Evaluators)
└── Program.cs        (End-to-End Orchestrator & Multi-Scenario Test Harness)
```

---

### Module 1: Core / Shared Domain

